{"id":"wb-3-102","name":"许国石坊","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"许国石坊","text":"许国石坊又称大学士坊，俗称八脚牌楼，座落于中国安徽省歙县县城中和街与打箍井街十字街口，东谯楼东侧，系明朝万历十二年（公元1584年）为武英殿大学士许国所建。许国石坊是徽州石坊的杰出代表，在石坊建筑史上占有突出地位，1988年被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%AE%B8%E5%9B%BD%E7%9F%B3%E5%9D%8A","revisionId":84929029,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84929029","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/153527d5d7847be5f569e494.jpg","title":"Xuguoshifang_5173.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xuguoshifang_5173.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/Xuguoshifang_5173.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Doctoroftcm","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​许国石坊，全国重点文物保护单位，位于安徽省歙县。","width":320,"height":227}}